  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAtr">II Atr</ref> 2.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ðeh hit gedriuen beo ⁊ hit ætfleo to hwilcre friðbyrig, ⁊ ða menn up ætberstan into ðære byrig, ðonne habban ða men frið ⁊ þæt hy him mid bringað.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And even if it is pursued and reaches any town included in the truce, and the men escape into the town, protection is to be afforded to them and to what they bring with them.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et licet abacta sit et applicetur ad aliquam curiam pacis, et homines euadant in ipsam curiam, pacem habeant et quod attulerint secum.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
